{"id":"u-da3f2687-286c-4e30-a88e-0264a5061a39","src":"community","title":"Becoming the Bull","author":"Big Lifts Chris","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/LPWyHb-becoming-the-bull","desc":"Becoming the Bull: Program Overview\nBecoming the Bull is a comprehensive 4-day powerbuilding split designed to turn you into an absolute powerhouse on the platform while packing on serious muscle mass. Built on the proven principles of modern powerlifting, this program merges elite strength accumulation with targeted hypertrophy work to ensure you don't just lift like a bull—you look like one, too.\n\nThe Core Philosophy\nPowerlifting Foundation: The core of the program revolves around mastering and progressively overloading the primary compound movements—the Squat, Bench Press, and Deadlift.\n\nHypertrophy Integration: After the heavy, low-rep strength work is complete, the focus shifts to moderate-to-high volume accessory movements. This builds the foundational muscle tissue necessary to support heavier lifts, bulletproofs your joints, and drives overall aesthetic growth.\n\nPeriodized Progression: The program utilizes wave progression to manage fatigue, prevent plateaus, and ensure consistent strength gains without central nervous system burnout.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-07-04T01:40:03.111Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":1800}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":75,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":1800}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct"